\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1.   God and Mary's own dear Son
\par \pard\li270\sl188\slmult0 Honoured Jesus, I adore you
\par You came as a child of man
\par took on our flesh and blood as well
\par save us Lord, we plead with you
\par Oh! our brother and our God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl188\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   All of us have heard for sure
\par \pard\li270\sl188\slmult0 what we lost through Adam's mistake
\par and into sin I was born
\par \pard\li405\sl188\slmult0 but (now) I'm pleading for pardon,
\par to the second Adam
\par for a new birth now in him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl188\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  You became just as I was
\par \pard\li405\sl188\slmult0 Let me be just also like you
\par Take off our sufferings from us
\par for we are wrestlers on this earth
\par give me portion of your grace
\par \pard       in your saving exercise.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

